            <ArticleTitle>[ECONOMIC EFFICIENCY TECHNOLOGIES DIAGNOSIS OF ISCHEMIC HEART DISEASE BY MAHNITOTOKARDIOHRAFIYI].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>94-105</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article is devoted to clinical--economic analysis of modern diagnostic technology--magnetocardiography by analyzing the &quot;cost-effectiveness&quot;. Economic effectiveness of diagnosis of coronary artery disease using magnetocardiography in terms of cost/effectivness is shown. The economicaly optimal sequence of several noninvasive methods for diagnosis of coronary artery disease is defined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
